						<div class="layout-columnas-4-item">
															<h3 class="h1 layout-columnas-4-item__titulo">05_</h3>
							
															<div class="layout-columnas-4-item__texto"><div class="field field--name-field-field-extpage-region field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-above">
<div class="field__items">
<div class="field__item">
<div class="paragraph paragraph--type--para-tener-en-cuenta paragraph--view-mode--default">
<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-card-list field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item">
<div class="field field--name-field-field-extpage-region field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-above">
<div class="field__items">
<div class="field__item">
<div class="paragraph paragraph--type--para-tener-en-cuenta paragraph--view-mode--default">
<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-card-list field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item">
<p><strong>La Feria de Abril </strong>cuenta con 450.000 metros cuadrados y 1.052 casetas.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
